---
import Container from "@components/Container.astro";
import PageLayout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import Link from "@components/Link.astro";
import { ABOUT, SITE, SOCIALS } from "@consts";
---

<PageLayout title={ABOUT.TITLE} description={ABOUT.DESCRIPTION}>
  <Container>
    <h1 class="animate font-semibold text-black dark:text-white mb-6">
      About
    </h1>

    <div class="space-y-16">
      <section>
        <article class="space-y-4">
          <p class="animate">
            With 15 years of total professional experience, including 13.5 years in software engineering (progressing from junior roles to a Staff/Architect level) and over 5 years specifically dedicated to architecting and building scalable AI platforms on K8s, Go, and Python. My career journey has evolved from foundational software development to leading complex AI infrastructure initiatives. I am driven by a passion for creating robust systems that empower complex AI solutions.
          </p>
          <p class="animate">
            My journey into AI was profoundly influenced by AlphaGo. As an accomplished amateur 5-dan Go player, witnessing AlphaGo's breakthrough was a key catalyst for my career pivot into the AI domain. This inspiration led me to self-teach Deep Reinforcement Learning, culminating in a technical seminar for my engineering team.
          </p>
          <p class="animate">
            Beyond core engineering, I am committed to community engagement and knowledge sharing. I've had the privilege of speaking at the Apache APISIX Meetup, sharing insights on high-performance gateways. I also revitalized and led the Tencent Football Association for over 200 members, successfully fostering a highly engaged and competitive community. Furthermore, I am a published translator, having translated technical books such as 'Practical Data Analysis' from English to Chinese, which deepened my professional knowledge and honed my bilingual technical communication skills.
          </p>
          <p class="animate">
            I am always excited to apply my expertise to challenging problems within dynamic, international environments, particularly in the realm of innovative AI engineering.
          </p>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="animate space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-end justify-between border-b border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 pb-4">
          <h5 class="font-medium text-black dark:text-white tracking-wide uppercase text-sm">
            Professional Experience
          </h5>
        </div>
        <ul class="flex flex-col">
          <li class="group py-6 border-b border-black/5 dark:border-white/5">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[5fr_4fr] sm:gap-x-8 sm:items-center">
              <h3 class="text-lg"><span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Architect</span>, Lovart</h3>
              <div class="font-serif italic text-black/50 dark:text-white/50 mt-2 sm:mt-0 text-sm sm:text-base">2025 — Present</div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 mt-2 text-sm">Architecting the core infrastructure for autonomous AI agents. Designing scalable orchestration frameworks that bridge complex LLM reasoning with reliable, real-world execution.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="group py-6 border-b border-black/5 dark:border-white/5">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[5fr_4fr] sm:gap-x-8 sm:items-center">
              <h3 class="text-lg"><span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Staff Engineer & AI Platform Architect</span>, Tencent</h3>
              <div class="font-serif italic text-black/50 dark:text-white/50 mt-2 sm:mt-0 text-sm sm:text-base">2018 — 2025</div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 mt-2 text-sm">Spearheaded the 0-to-1 architecture of Tencent Cloud's unified AI platform and engineered high-performance cloud-native gateways. Scaled infrastructure to flawlessly absorb 100x traffic surges during the explosive LLM boom with zero downtime.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="group py-6 border-b border-black/5 dark:border-white/5">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[5fr_4fr] sm:gap-x-8 sm:items-center">
              <h3 class="text-lg"><span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Senior Backend Engineer</span>, Tencent</h3>
              <div class="font-serif italic text-black/50 dark:text-white/50 mt-2 sm:mt-0 text-sm sm:text-base">2016 — 2018</div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 mt-2 text-sm">Drove the critical microservices refactoring for massive-scale brand advertising systems, significantly elevating architectural scalability.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="group py-6 border-b border-black/5 dark:border-white/5">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[5fr_4fr] sm:gap-x-8 sm:items-center">
              <h3 class="text-lg"><span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Senior Engineer</span>, Bilibili</h3>
              <div class="font-serif italic text-black/50 dark:text-white/50 mt-2 sm:mt-0 text-sm sm:text-base">2016</div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 mt-2 text-sm">Participated in the core architecture migration towards microservices, building foundational backend systems for millions of creators.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="group py-6 border-b border-black/5 dark:border-white/5">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[5fr_4fr] sm:gap-x-8 sm:items-center">
              <h3 class="text-lg"><span class="font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Core Backend Developer</span>, Adways (Nint)</h3>
              <div class="font-serif italic text-black/50 dark:text-white/50 mt-2 sm:mt-0 text-sm sm:text-base">2012 — 2015</div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-black/60 dark:text-white/60 mt-2 text-sm">Acted as an early founding engineer to build a data-intensive e-commerce analytics product from scratch, laying a lifelong foundation in robust system design.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="animate space-y-4">
        <h5 class="font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
          Connect
        </h5>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
          <Link href="https://github.com/diaosj" external>github ↗</Link>
          <Link href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/shoujun-diao/" external>linkedin ↗</Link>
          <Link href="https://x.com/diaosj" external>twitter ↗</Link>
          <Link href={`mailto:${SITE.EMAIL}`}>email ↗</Link>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </Container>
</PageLayout>
